{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world of wonder and magic, an epic adventure awaits!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist meets a tragic end, struck by a truck, only to be reborn into an isekai. Guided by a Goddess, they embark on a journey to become a Mage Adventurer.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover treasures in chests, obtain powerful equipment, and grow stronger.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Battle monsters, level up, and evolve into a legendary hero.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Take on challenging quests from the Adventurer's Guild.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique roguelike elements: choose one of three enhancement scrolls\u2014every decision shapes your destiny.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize your path with a meticulously designed Skill Tree system.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With pixel art visuals and a blend of adventure, RPG, and light roguelike mechanics, experience a Metroidvania-style world. Follow the protagonist's journey to overcome trials, defeat the Demon King, and forge your own legend!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this adventure and start your isekai journey today!  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447120?t=1774005190","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447120/0380e221a92039d7fff48cff9f2b305d54a109d2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774005190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447120/5db705c1012c1307de9a5aeccdbc168a7241d056/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774005190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447120/5db705c1012c1307de9a5aeccdbc168a7241d056/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774005190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world of wonder and magic, an epic adventure awaits!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist meets a tragic end, struck by a truck, only to be reborn into an isekai. Guided by a Goddess, they embark on a journey to become a Mage Adventurer.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover treasures in chests, obtain powerful equipment, and grow stronger.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Battle monsters, level up, and evolve into a legendary hero.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Take on challenging quests from the Adventurer's Guild.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique roguelike elements: choose one of three enhancement scrolls\u2014every decision shapes your destiny.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize your path with a meticulously designed Skill Tree system.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With pixel art visuals and a blend of adventure, RPG, and light roguelike mechanics, experience a Metroidvania-style world. Follow the protagonist's journey to overcome trials, defeat the Demon King, and forge your own legend!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join this adventure and start your isekai journey today!  </p>","developers":["TongLee"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447120/0770698e54b10138ab0072d7f361a06e4e71cdcb/header.jpg?t=1774005190","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3447120/831561/a51ae006f3c0081eaeb724607c391026a0bc6fc7/1750851998/dash_av1.mpd?